<title>INDIA: Indian January truck production rises.</title>
<headline>Indian January truck production rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indian production of trucks rose in January compared to the same month in 1996, the Association of Indian Automobile Manufacturers (AIAM) said in a monthly statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>				   PRODUCTION (in units)</p>
<p>		  Jan 97  Dec 96  Jan 96  Apr96-Jan97  Apr95-Jan96</p>
<p>  TRUCKS	14,286  14,522  10,994    125,211	103,049</p>
<p>				     SALES (in units)</p>
<p>		  Jan 97  Dec 96  Jan 96  Apr96-Jan97  Apr95-Jan96</p>
<p>  TRUCKS	13,447  12,464  10,927     118,410	100,218</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11-301-2024</p>
</text>
